cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to Kestrel-49M, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Kestrel-49M: a 49.5M-parameter language model trained from scratch"
abstract: >-
  A 49,482,752-parameter decoder-only language model trained from random
  initialization on a 6-billion-token corpus with its own 16k BPE tokenizer,
  in 2.08 H100-hours. Gold, Track 01 (Foundational LLM Development), Global
  Innovation Build Challenge V2.
authors:
  - alias: EmiRZx
repository-code: "https://github.com/EmiRZx/kestrel-49m"
url: "https://github.com/EmiRZx/kestrel-49m"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-24"
keywords:
  - language model
  - small language model
  - pretraining
  - muon optimizer
  - benchmark decontamination
  - synthetic data
